    "Every Attention item is dismissible. Dismissal hides only the derived reminder for the selected duration; it never changes the note, its Connections, Human Review, or qualification." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Every Attention item is dismissible. Dismissal hides only the derived reminder for the selected duration; it never changes the note, its Connections, Human Review, or qualification."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个关注项都可以暂时忽略。忽略后只会在所选时段隐藏这条派生提醒；不会更改笔记、关联、研究者评审或评审结论。"
          }
        }
