        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 保留了原始编辑缓冲区，因为此文档已无法通过当前脉络访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium stores the small portable .scholium folder beside Works. macOS therefore asks once for access to the folder containing Works; it is not added as a fourth vault." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium stores the small portable .scholium folder beside Works. macOS therefore asks once for access to the folder containing Works; it is not added as a fourth vault."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 将小型便携式 .scholium 文件夹存放在“写作”研究库旁。因此，macOS 会请求访问包含“写作”的文件夹；该文件夹不会成为第四个研究库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium talks only to Zotero Desktop on localhost. No account, password, online API key, or Zotero data-folder permission is required. Scholium never modifies Zotero data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium talks only to Zotero Desktop on localhost. No account, password, online API key, or Zotero data-folder permission is required. Scholium never modifies Zotero data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 仅与本地主机上的 Zotero 桌面对话。不需要帐户、密码、在线 API 密钥或 Zotero 数据文件夹权限。Scholium 永远不会修改 Zotero 数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium validates package structure and routing, not philosophical quality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium validates package structure and routing, not philosophical quality."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 验证包结构和路由，而不是哲学质量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will store Zotero item %@ in the Analysis so future matches are stable. Zotero itself remains unchanged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium will store Zotero item %@ in the Analysis so future matches are stable. Zotero itself remains unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会将 Zotero 项目 %@ 存储在分析中，因此未来的匹配是稳定的。Zotero 本身保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium will store Zotero item %arg in the Analysis so future matches are stable. Zotero itself remains unchanged." : {
